{
  "id": "1JN.4",
  "number": "4",
  "bookId": "1JN",
  "reference": "1 Yohana 4",
  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1JN 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Guroorooda huumwa ea dea ng'uyeega",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fuga aabwariinyi, adoamwaschi giliwas guroorooda, iissa ghoonyo asima gurooruunatsu ak ghoadaayi ea gaba ASEETA; aba gideaba nihidu jeeda ng'eanyiida sibanga saang'a bea ng'uyeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba nih abeeda gajanala Guroorooda ASEETA: guroorooda mwas gideaba Yesu Gristo nuwu nea ghoana saseeda gaba ASEETA, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea guroorooda wassean mamwasa Yesu maba ASEETA. Nih guroorooda heawa Gristohi, was deaghayi oayiinyi gideaba gayghwahidu, ak ghamneawa ea nigeawiit ghwahidu jeeda ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Diibiga manang'i, agooga goobeayi ASEETA, ak ea noajoarji saawa; aba gideaba dea mida jeedeang'wa ea haweewa dea mida jeeda ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh gaba ng'eanyiida, ak gabaloola ng'asheega ng'eanyiida, ak gooleeysiit ng'eanyiida saawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aseasa geebeayi ASEETA. Siida nal ASEETA gaygooleeyseasa iit, nea dea maba ASEETA ea maygooleeyseasa iit. Ak aba seareani gajeanala guroorooda huumwa ea guroorooda ramaseanda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ASEETA bariinyeega gil",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjoogeasu aabwariinyi, eabwariinya geat aba gideaba bariinyeega gwaleabu heeda ASEETA, ak giliwas sih mideawa bariinyeega gwajiilu ASEETA, ak ghwanal ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea siida mandeawana bariinyeega ea miighwanal ASEETA aba gideaba ASEETA bariinyeega gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba seareani bariinyeega ASEETA geataajiit aba jeedeanya, gideaba ASEETA goojeagu Orjeedaanyi was haghasheeda badayda ng'eanyiida, ak abeeda geanyaschi eaweega aba badaydaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea nih ea bariinyeega, mii gideaba geabwariinyi aseasa ASEETA ghabwariinyeasa niny ak goojeagu Orjeedaanyi ghoah dea adayda leadeeda riing'eegaasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fuga aabwariinyi, iinukwa ghabwariiyduneasa ASEETA, gammiisa gideaba gajeebariinya geat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manda siida nidaah ASEETA; iisibwariinyayi geat, abeeda ASEETA goobiida jeedeanya, ak bariinyeagaaschi ea majeek aba jeedeanya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba seareani geanali gideaba geepiidi jeadaanyi, ak eara niny gwanda jeedeanya, aba gideaba nigooneasa Gurooroadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak aseasa ea sidaayi nea simuuwu gideaba Bwaabwa niijeagu Orjeedaanyi ghoah lealnoocheanda ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Giliwas sih mwas gideaba Yesu Orjeeda ASEETA gil, abeeda ASEETA goobiida jeadaanyi nea goobiida niny jeeda ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aseasa geanali ak geamwaschi ASEETA aba badahuukaasa. ASEETA bariinyeega, nea siida abiida jeeda bariinyeega, goobiida jeeda ASEETA, ak goobiida ASEETA jeadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba jeedeaba bariinyeesu simajeegiichi aba heedeanya, ak geamwaschi aba eaweeda girgweageeda, aba gideaba giduurji niny ea gisiwuurjeewi gil aba badaydeaba ng'eanyiini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba jeeda bariinyeega manda muuwda, ak bariinyeega huumwa gaygageanda muuwda. Aba gideaba muuwda gwandeawa ghoorjooda, ak siida mideawa muuwda ea mii hidaat aba bariinyeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aseasa geabwariinyi, aba gideaba goosheeda niny ghabwariinyeasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida iyayi, “Ghaabwariinyi ASEETA,” nea ghwasit orjeeda ghaamwat, abeeda siisi gabang'uya; aba gideaba siida mwabwariinya orjeeda ghaamwat nidaah, moamu ghabwariiy ASEETA miighwadaah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak diigheanji gagooneasa niny gideaba siida bwariiy ASEETA, dabwariinya eara orjeeda ghaamwat.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
